# Play test of The Clockwork Orchard (CIPlay clockwork_orchard, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# plateau's top at 9.8 m; the ramp up its north-west cliff from -30 25 (2.6 m) to -7 21 (9.8 m); the lean-to x -12..-7.5,
# z 11..14 (floor 9.9 m, open to the south); the pumps at -19 0 (pineapple), 0 -17 (mango), 19 0 (banana); the fountain
# at 0 0; the workshop on the south plain x -3..3, z -38.5..-29.5 (floor 2.6 m), its shutter at 1.5 -38.5
island The Clockwork Orchard
expect step 0
expect title The Water Order
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden fountainwheel
wait 5

# Up the ramp cut in the cliff onto the plateau; the diagram in the lean-to; the toolbox's crank
walk -30.5 25.2 to -18.5 23 to -7 21 to -6 18 h=9.8
zone orchard
expect step 0
walk -6 18 to -6 9 to -9.75 9.5 to -9.75 12.5 h=9.9 below=12
read Inventor's diagram
expect step 1
use pineapplepump
expect message crank
open Inventor's toolbox
expect story crank 1
expect step 2

# The pumps out of order: the mango pump first chokes them all; then pineapple, mango, banana in the diagram's order
walk -6 10 to -2 0 to 0 -10 to 0 -15 h=9.8
use mangopump
expect message choke
expect hidden mangocog
use pineapplepump
expect shown pineapplecog
use bananapump
expect message choke
expect hidden pineapplecog
use pineapplepump
use mangopump
expect shown mangocog
use bananapump
expect shown bananacog
expect shown fountainwheel
expect story flow 1
expect step 3

# Down the ramp and round to the workshop under the south cliff: Raft's story machinery - the crank wheel by the workshop
# lifts the parts crate's shutter (once); then in under the shutter (down into the floor) to the strongbox
walk -7 21 to -18.5 23 to -30.5 25.2 h=2.6
walk -32 22 to -30 0 to -24 -26 to -10 -38 to 1.5 -42 h=2.5
expect hidden partscrate
use partscrank
expect shown partscrate
open Inventor's parts crate
expect item Hinge 2
expect step 4
walk 1.5 -42 to 1.5 -37.5 to 0 -35 to -1.5 -32 h=2.6 below=5
zone workshop
expect step 4
open Inventor's strongbox
expect item Blueprint_WaterTank 1
expect done
# (the crank wheel turns only once; the spare chest stays bolted until the hand lever on the other side is pulled)
use partscrank
expect message turned as far as it goes
open Inventor's spare chest
expect message bolted shut
use sparelever
expect message bolt slides back
open Inventor's spare chest
expect item MetalIngot 2
